    {
      "lyric": "  Make his fight on the hill in the early day",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "E5",
          "col": 0
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  Constant chill deep inside",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G5",
          "col": 0
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  Shouting gun, on they run through the endless grey",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "E5",
          "col": 0
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  On the fight, for they are right, yes, by who's to say?",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G5",
          "col": 0
        },
        {
          "chord": "C5",
          "col": 29
        },
        {
          "chord": "A5",
          "col": 44
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  For a hill men would kill, why? They do not know",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "E5",
          "col": 0
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  Stiffened wounds test there their pride",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "G5",
          "col": 0
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
    },
    {
      "lyric": "  Men of five, still alive through the raging glow",
      "chords": [
        {
          "chord": "E5",
          "col": 0
        }
      ],
      "section": false,
      "t": null
